  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Human Security and Inclusive Digital Transformation: Knowledge Management for Resilient and Sustainable Development in Jalisco</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">strengthen the articulation of initiatives and public and private sector programs to promote human security through the development of ethical, integral and inclusive digital ecosystems in workers&apos; and employers&apos; organizations , seeking the promotion and generation of political agendas at local levels for digital development as a catalyst for the generation of comprehensive responses to multidimensional problems in territories with high vulnerability and marginalization in the state of Jalisco.</narrative>
  </description>
